<https://hexplain.io/ns/video#StreamShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: instances of vdv:VideoStream, vdv:VideoTrack; subjects using vdv:aspectRatio, vdv:audioChannels, vdv:frameCount, vdv:frameRate, vdv:frameRateDenominator, vdv:frameRateNumerator, vdv:scanType Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
